{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17740","headline":"送司徒童子 · 杨巨源","name":"送司徒童子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卫多君子鲁多儒，七岁闻天笑舞雩。\n光彩春风初转蕙，性灵秋水不藏珠。\n两经在口知名小，百拜垂髫禀气殊。\n况复元侯旌尔善，桂林枝上得鵷雏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17740.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17740","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}